From 5c837bb3c965f2dfc7773ddef0e90bf252661da9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AegisOS Build <build@aegisos.local>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 22:04:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 88/90] systemui: migrate ReferenceGlobalRootComponent to
 Kotlin

KSP (Kotlin Symbol Processing), the module's annotation processor since
upstream commit e00adb95523b8 enabled enable_ksp for SystemUI-application,
does not process plain .java sources. This was the last remaining .java
@Component in the SystemUI tree; every other Dagger component here is
already Kotlin. Converting it lets KSP actually generate
DaggerReferenceGlobalRootComponent, which the initializer requires.
---
 ...t.java => ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.kt} | 29 +++++++------------
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)
 rename packages/SystemUI/application/src/com/android/systemui/dagger/{ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.java => ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.kt} (51%)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/application/src/com/android/systemui/dagger/ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.java b/packages/SystemUI/application/src/com/android/systemui/dagger/ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.kt
similarity index 51%
rename from packages/SystemUI/application/src/com/android/systemui/dagger/ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.java
rename to packages/SystemUI/application/src/com/android/systemui/dagger/ReferenceGlobalRootComponent.kt
index c663db0a427a..ca2e8ec3c3b4 100644
